<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/ieee-9274-1-1-2023-xapi> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "xAPI" <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/ieee-9274-1-1-2023-xapi/versions/1> .
<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/ieee-9274-1-1-2023-xapi> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The IEEE standard for the xAPI data model and RESTful web service used to communicate learner and human-performance experience data between activities and a Learning Record Store (LRS). It standardizes the JSON-based model and service behavior derived from xAPI 1.0.3." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/ieee-9274-1-1-2023-xapi/versions/1> .
