<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/ieee-9274-1-1-2023-xapi> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "IEEE 9274.1.1-2023 — Experience API (xAPI)" <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/ieee-9274-1-1-2023-xapi/versions/1> .
<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/ieee-9274-1-1-2023-xapi> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/experience-api-xapi> <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/ieee-9274-1-1-2023-xapi/versions/1> .
<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/ieee-9274-1-1-2023-xapi> <https://glossarystudio.app/ns/activeDefinition> <https://id.i2idl.org/definitions/ieee-9274-1-1-2023-xapi-1> <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/ieee-9274-1-1-2023-xapi/versions/1> .
<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/ieee-9274-1-1-2023-xapi> <https://glossarystudio.app/ns/editorialExplanation> "xAPI provides a common way for heterogeneous learning, performance, simulation, mobile, and other systems to record and exchange experience data outside the boundaries of a single LMS." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/ieee-9274-1-1-2023-xapi/versions/1> .
